{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14218130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14218130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421813001:1":{"text":"……えっ、成長魔法薬をかけたらキノコが枯れた！？","source_cn":"使用了速生魔药后，巨蕈竟然枯萎了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335FBF858A9FF414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421813002:1":{"text":"それに、トビキノコまで襲ってきたんだけど！！な、なんで……？","source_cn":"还有那些突然冒出来攻击我们的菇灵，这究竟是怎么回事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D5199BEB89D8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421813003:1":{"text":"それは、あなたたちがここの生態を壊したからよ！","source_cn":"因为你们破坏了这里的生态！破坏了它们的家园！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8914982AEC2A7456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421813004:1":{"text":"地上の人間は……どうしてこんなことを……もうやめて……","source_cn":"你们是……地表的人……你们有什么目的？呜……不要伤害我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4224EE7F071DB7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421813005:1":{"text":"ちっ、違うんだ！僕はただ、成長を早めたかっただけで！","source_cn":"抱歉，我没有想伤害任何生物，我只想让它长得更快些！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1854433236AA4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421813006:1":{"text":"ひどい……私の育てた花まで枯れちゃった……見てよ、あれ……","source_cn":"呜……我种的花也枯萎了……看看这周围……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x838C77B6DC575F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"ガリ","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的少女":{"text":"臆病な少女","source":"胆怯的少女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}